  "content": "<h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fhoster24.org%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#00f;font-size:24px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/566412/description_22188d49-df21-4e21-ba83-cc6001713fa7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"830\" height=\"128\"></a></h2><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">捉<span style=\"color:#f90\">迷</span></span></span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#00f\"><span style=\"color:#f90\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">藏</span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一個讓你可以</span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">玩捉迷藏的地圖</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 適合 2-4 位玩家</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\">為什麼你該下載這張地圖</span></strong></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 在 3 張大地圖中遊玩（未來可能增加更多）</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 許多可以躲藏的地方</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 充足的時間讓躲藏者藏身</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 我們仍在持續開發這張地圖</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>如果發現錯誤怎麼辦</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若您發現錯誤，請留言或寄信至 Lenny230809@gmail.com</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>地圖中有遊戲模式嗎</strong></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">地圖中有 2 種遊戲模式（普通 &amp; 方塊）</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">普通模式：一般的捉迷藏</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方塊模式：一般的捉迷藏，但加入了方塊</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>創作者</strong></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- Play it now（指揮官）</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- lyfeyt2（建築師）</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>計劃中的更新</strong></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 可能新增超過 3 張地圖</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/twhqbCfdDP\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3cc\"><strong>Discord</strong></span></a></span></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>也請看看我們的其他地圖</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預告片：</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C1j6kkvrmvY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"788\" height=\"433\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
